{"seq":2,"slug":"takedown-suspension-enforcement","title":"下架、listing 冻结与账户暂停的执行传播机制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/violation-takedown-monitoring/takedown-suspension-enforcement","wordCount":2929,"readingTime":12,"html":"<h1 id=\"下架-listing-冻结与账户暂停的执行传播机制\">下架、listing 冻结与账户暂停的执行传播机制</h1><p>凌晨 3 点一条 <code>ctg.listing.product_safety.gpsr.eu</code> 判定成立，运维看到的不是「一条违规」，而是 40 秒内的连锁反应：该 ASIN 从搜索与详情页消失、FBA 在途库存转为不可售、该 SKU 广告自动暂停、已下单订单转入人工审核、后台弹出绩效通知、资金预留比例从 0 调到 30%。这不是一次函数调用，而是<strong>一条处置决策沿依赖图向多个子系统传播</strong>的过程。判定正确性由<a href=\"violation-taxonomy-policy-engine\">违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模</a>保证；本文关心判定之后——<strong>动作怎么分类、往哪传播、如何不重复不遗漏、出错怎么回滚、恢复时怎么对称地传回去</strong>。传播写错，代价是「商品被下架但钱还在扣」「资金解冻了但 listing 还是死的」这类账单式事故。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-执行传播是一张有向可达图\">核心概念：执行传播是一张有向可达图</h2><p>把「处置」当成对象而非布尔值，是这条链路的第一性认识。处置决策 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 携带五元组 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟨</mo><mtext>term</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>severity</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>subject</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>scope</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>effective_from</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">⟩</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\langle \\text{term}, \\text{severity}, \\text{subject}, \\text{scope}, \\text{effective\\_from} \\rangle</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⟨</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">term</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">severity</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">subject</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scope</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">effective_from</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">⟩</span></span></span></span></span>，<code>subject</code> 是被处置主体（listing / SKU / 店铺 / 账户），<code>scope</code> 是作用面。传播引擎把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 映射到一组跨子系统命令，保证要么全部生效、要么全部不生效。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  D[处置决策 d] --&gt; R[传播路由 Router]&#10;  R --&gt; C1[商品域&lt;br/&gt;抑制 / 冻结]&#10;  R --&gt; C2[库存域&lt;br/&gt;库存转不可售]&#10;  R --&gt; C3[流量域&lt;br/&gt;暂停广告]&#10;  R --&gt; C4[交易域&lt;br/&gt;拦截新单]&#10;  R --&gt; C5[资金域&lt;br/&gt;提高预留比例]&#10;  R --&gt; C6[通知域&lt;br/&gt;绩效通知 + 理由说明]&#10;  C1 --&gt; L[执行账本]&#10;  C2 --&gt; L&#10;  C3 --&gt; L&#10;  C4 --&gt; L&#10;  C5 --&gt; L&#10;  C6 --&gt; L&#10;  L --&gt; A[审计 / 申诉 / 恢复]&#10;  A --&gt;|推翻| U[补偿事务&lt;br/&gt;反向传播]&#10;  U --&gt; C1&#10;  U --&gt; C5\">graph TD\n  D[处置决策 d] --&gt; R[传播路由 Router]\n  R --&gt; C1[商品域&lt;br/&gt;抑制 / 冻结]\n  R --&gt; C2[库存域&lt;br/&gt;库存转不可售]\n  R --&gt; C3[流量域&lt;br/&gt;暂停广告]\n  R --&gt; C4[交易域&lt;br/&gt;拦截新单]\n  R --&gt; C5[资金域&lt;br/&gt;提高预留比例]\n  R --&gt; C6[通知域&lt;br/&gt;绩效通知 + 理由说明]\n  C1 --&gt; L[执行账本]\n  C2 --&gt; L\n  C3 --&gt; L\n  C4 --&gt; L\n  C5 --&gt; L\n  C6 --&gt; L\n  L --&gt; A[审计 / 申诉 / 恢复]\n  A --&gt;|推翻| U[补偿事务&lt;br/&gt;反向传播]\n  U --&gt; C1\n  U --&gt; C5</pre><p>三条关键性质：<strong>传播是沿依赖图的可达性计算</strong>——「下架 listing」的可达集含库存与流量，却不天然含资金，资金节点只对 <code>severity &gt;= high</code> 或账户级 subject 开放；<strong>边带方向与权重</strong>，权重表达子系统对该条款的敏感度；<strong>账本是所有分支的汇聚点</strong>，是唯一能回答「这个 ASIN 为什么不可售」的地方。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>处置粒度</th>\n<th>典型 subject</th>\n<th>传播可达集</th>\n<th>可逆性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>内容抑制</td>\n<td>单条 listing 字段</td>\n<td>商品域 + 通知域</td>\n<td>改字段即自动恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Listing 下架</td>\n<td>单条 ASIN</td>\n<td>商品 + 流量 + 交易（新单）</td>\n<td>整改或申诉后恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SKU / 变体冻结</td>\n<td>SKU 或变体族</td>\n<td>商品 + 库存 + 流量</td>\n<td>申诉通过后恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>类目 / 品牌限制</td>\n<td>类目或品牌</td>\n<td>商品 + 流量 + 资金</td>\n<td>需补充资质</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>销售权限暂停</td>\n<td>账户（全店）</td>\n<td>全部六个域</td>\n<td>申诉通过后恢复</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>账户终止</td>\n<td>账户</td>\n<td>全部 + 资金扣押</td>\n<td>不可逆或极难逆转</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"执行动作的分类与作用面\">执行动作的分类与作用面</h2><p><strong>内容抑制（suppression）</strong> 最轻：listing 仍在但不可被搜索到，触发多为属性缺失、主图不合规、标题含受限词；Amazon 的抑制状态由字段校验派生而非独立状态位，整改后自动解除。<strong>Listing 下架（takedown）</strong> 是独立状态位，必须由显式命令写入、显式命令解除——这正是它需要账本的原因。<strong>账户级暂停（suspension）</strong> 传播面最大：Amazon 在 Business Solutions Agreement 第 3 条下保留暂停销售权限的权利，并通过账户状况评级（AHR）把多类政策违规折算为 0–1000 分，≥200 为 Good、100–199 为 At Risk、&lt;100 为 Unhealthy（Amazon Seller Central「Account Health」文档）。AHR 是<strong>传播的输入信号之一，不是执行本身</strong>。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>平台</th>\n<th>执行信号中枢</th>\n<th>账户级动作的触发语义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Amazon</td>\n<td>账户状况评级 AHR（0–1000）</td>\n<td>分数区间 + 严重度共同决定，暂停附绩效通知与申诉入口</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TikTok Shop</td>\n<td>店铺违规积分 + 体验分</td>\n<td>积分累进到阈值 → 下架 / 限权 / 清退</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>eBay</td>\n<td>Seller Standards 不良交易率</td>\n<td>月度评估，超标降级 Below Standard</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Walmart</td>\n<td>Seller Performance（90 天滚动）</td>\n<td>履约指标超标 → 暂停 + 付款延迟</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>工程结论：<strong>执行动作必须按作用粒度而非违规类型建模</strong>。违规类型有成百上千种，作用粒度只有上表那几档；把命令建模为 <code>(granularity, subject, action)</code> 三元组，新增条款通常无需新增执行动作，只需在路由表指定目标粒度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"爆炸半径控制-最小作用面与隔离而非清除\">爆炸半径控制：最小作用面与隔离而非清除</h2><p>同一条违规最容易犯的错是过度执行——把问题 ASIN 的整条变体族、整个品牌甚至整个账户一起处理掉，既伤卖家也伤 GMV，申诉阶段还极易被推翻。正确的做法是把处置建模为<strong>带覆盖约束的最小化问题</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></munder><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">(</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>harm</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>seller</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.8em\" maxsize=\"1.8em\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>s.t. coverage</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}^*(v) = \\arg\\min_{A \\in \\mathcal{A}(v)} \\Big( c_{\\text{harm}}(A) + c_{\\text{seller}}(A) \\Big) \\quad \\text{s.t.} \\ \\text{coverage}(A, v) = 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.116em;vertical-align:-0.966em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.309em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord mathcal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.966em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.8em;vertical-align:-0.65em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size2\">)</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">s.t.</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">coverage</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}(v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是能消除违规风险的候选动作族，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>harm</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{harm}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是放任不管的期望损害（买家 + 监管风险），<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>seller</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{seller}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">seller</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是误杀成本（损失 + 申诉工单）。产品安全类条款 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>harm</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{harm}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">harm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 极高，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 12: \\mathcal{A}^̲_\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\mathcal{A}^_</span></span> 会升到账户级；标题字符这类平台政策条款 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">_</mi><mtext>harm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c\\_{\\text{harm}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">_</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">harm</span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 低，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex-error\" title=\"ParseError: KaTeX parse error: Expected group after &#x27;^&#x27; at position 12: \\mathcal{A}^̲_\" style=\"color:#cc0000\">\\mathcal{A}^_</span></span> 通常只落在内容抑制。<strong>同一优化框架因成本参数不同给出不同幅度的动作</strong>——这就是分级处置在数学上的样子。工程上还须区分<strong>隔离（quarantine）与清除（purge）</strong>：隔离是可逆软处置（商品转不可售、流量剥离、提高预留），数据全留；清除是删除 listing、销毁库存记录、扣押资金。默认必须落在隔离，因为申诉推翻后的恢复成本相差两个数量级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"传播的可靠性-幂等-定序与补偿\">传播的可靠性：幂等、定序与补偿</h2><p>一次处置向六个子系统发命令，跨进程、跨服务、跨消息队列，失败几乎必然：库存超时、通知重复投递、资金重试。因此传播必须是<strong>至少一次投递 + 幂等应用</strong>，幂等的数学表达是重复应用不动点 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>∘</mo><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mtext>apply</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>k</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{apply}(k) \\circ \\text{apply}(k) = \\text{apply}(k)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∘</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">apply</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是由 <code>(term, subject, scope, effective_from, action)</code> 派生的幂等键。实现上用<strong>事务性发件箱（transactional outbox）</strong>：决策与其待发命令在同一数据库事务落库，再由投递器推给各子系统，成功后标记、可重试错误指数退避、不可重试错误进补偿队列；去重靠幂等键而非「不重试」，后台另以对账任务比对账本与各子系统的实际状态。</p>\n<p><strong>定序</strong>同样关键：同一 ASIN 上「下架」与「恢复」并发到达，若不定序，子系统可能先恢复后下架，停在错误状态。解法是给每条 <code>(subject, action-class)</code> 通道赋单调版本号，子系统只接受版本号更大的命令，即按版本号的 last-writer-wins，而非按到达时间。<strong>补偿</strong>处理不可重试的失败：库存冻结失败而 listing 已下架时，传播不应停在半途，而应发反向命令撤销已生效分支，回到传播前的一致状态，再把决策标记为「传播未完成」交人工。半途状态比完全不执行更危险——它让卖家看到「listing 死了但库存照样在卖」，直接引发二次客诉。传播还需<strong>时延预算</strong>：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>visible</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>decide</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>outbox</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>queue</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>δ</mi><mtext>edge</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_{\\text{visible}} = T_{\\text{decide}} + \\delta_{\\text{outbox}} + \\delta_{\\text{queue}} + \\delta_{\\text{edge}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">visible</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">decide</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8444em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">outbox</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">queue</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0379em;\">δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0379em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">edge</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。合规上这条链有硬上限：DSA（Regulation (EU) 2022/2065）Art. 17 要求限制措施附<strong>理由说明</strong>，P2B（Regulation (EU) 2019/1150）要求在限制或终止前通知并给出理由。通知若是六分支里最慢的一支，卖家会先发现商品消失、再收到解释，通知因此必须与执行<strong>并行发出</strong>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态机与时序语义\">状态机与时序语义</h2><p>listing 或账户的执行状态不是布尔值，而是有限状态机：<code>Normal → UnderReview → Suppressed → TakenDown → Suspended → Appealed → Reinstated / Terminated</code>。两条铁律是<strong>只允许沿合法边迁移</strong>，且<strong>每次迁移写账本</strong>。其核心语义是 <strong><code>effective_from</code> 用哪个时点</strong>：监管条款有生效日，用今天的规则回溯判定昨天上架的商品，是申诉被推翻的高频原因——判定必须用下单或上架时点的规则版本。执行侧同理，一次处置的 <code>effective_from</code> 决定它影响哪些在途订单，已付款未发货的订单通常给宽限窗（grace window），窗内允许完成履约、窗外拦截。「下架」因此不等于「断单」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通知-证据与审计随处置一同传播\">通知、证据与审计随处置一同传播</h2><p>通知分支携带四件必须与执行同时到达的东西——<strong>条款 ID、事实与证据快照、申诉入口、时限</strong>。DSA Art. 17 要求理由说明包含措施所依据的事实与环境，Art. 20 要求受限方有内部投诉处理系统，Art. 21 要求提供经认证的庭外争议解决路径。这些不是客服话术，而是结构化数据——申诉表单的条款下拉、资金预留的原因码、合规报表的口径全部引用同一组标识符，因此<a href=\"violation-taxonomy-policy-engine\">违规分类法</a>里的分层条款 ID 在这里第二次发挥作用：它是通知、执行、账本、申诉四处共享的契约。</p>\n<p><strong>执行账本（enforcement ledger）</strong> 是审计的物理载体，按追加写记录每条 <code>(决策 ID, term, subject, action, 命令 ID, 应用时间, 幂等键, 版本号)</code>，且<strong>不可回填</strong>——它作为审计证据的效力取决于写入时点，事后补写的记录在法律上不成立。有了账本才能回答：这条 ASIN 为什么不可售（沿 subject 反查）、这条资金预留由哪几条条款共同触发（按 subject 聚合 term）、通知是否真的发出（按分支状态查询）。没有账本，账号健康系统只能给出「分数」，给不出「因果」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"恢复路径必须与处置路径对称\">恢复路径必须与处置路径对称</h2><p>申诉推翻后，恢复必须<strong>沿处置时走过的同一条可达图反向传播</strong>，每一分支都有对应逆操作：listing 解除下架、SKU 解冻、库存转可售、广告恢复（通常只恢复状态不恢复投放参数）、在途订单解除审核、资金预留比例回落、通知域发出恢复说明。对称性有两条工程约束。<strong>第一，逆操作必须由处置账本驱动，而非由当前状态推导</strong>：从账本读「当初对这条 decision 做了什么」，逐条生成逆命令；凭当前状态反推，中途任何人工干预都会导致恢复不完整。<strong>第二，恢复也存在时延且必须显式管理</strong>：Amazon 的正常放款按 14 天结算周期，存在绩效风险的账户可被延长预留，Business Solutions Agreement 下最长可达 90 天。恢复的唯一验收不变量是：<strong>处置账本中每条已生效命令，都存在一条对应的、已生效的逆命令。</strong></p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>执行传播 = 处置决策沿依赖图的可达性计算</strong>；六个作用域（商品 / 库存 / 流量 / 交易 / 资金 / 通知）由 <code>severity + scope</code> 决定是否纳入，账本是唯一能回答「为什么现在这样」的汇聚点。</li>\n<li>执行动作按<strong>作用粒度</strong>（内容抑制 / 下架 / SKU 冻结 / 类目限制 / 账户暂停 / 终止）建模，而非按违规类型；新增条款通常只需在路由表指定目标粒度。</li>\n<li>爆炸半径用<strong>带覆盖约束的最小化</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"script\">A</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{A}^*(v)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathcal\">A</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 控制；默认走可逆的<strong>隔离</strong>。</li>\n<li>传播靠 <strong>outbox + 幂等键 + 版本定序 + 补偿事务</strong> 做到不重复不遗漏；半途状态必须被检测并回退。</li>\n<li>时序上判定用<strong>下单/上架时点</strong>的规则版本，执行给在途订单宽限窗；通知与执行<strong>并行</strong>发出，因为 DSA Art. 17 与 P2B 把理由说明置于限制措施的必要组成部分。</li>\n<li>恢复必须<strong>由处置账本驱动、与处置路径对称</strong>，唯一不变量是「每条已生效命令都有已生效的逆命令」；资金恢复的时延（预留最长可至 90 天）需向卖家明示。</li>\n<li>本文承接判定底座（<a href=\"violation-taxonomy-policy-engine\">违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模</a>），其输出是申诉与恢复流程的输入。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"下架、listing 冻结与账户暂停的执行传播机制","id":"下架-listing-冻结与账户暂停的执行传播机制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：执行传播是一张有向可达图","id":"核心概念-执行传播是一张有向可达图"},{"level":2,"text":"执行动作的分类与作用面","id":"执行动作的分类与作用面"},{"level":2,"text":"爆炸半径控制：最小作用面与隔离而非清除","id":"爆炸半径控制-最小作用面与隔离而非清除"},{"level":2,"text":"传播的可靠性：幂等、定序与补偿","id":"传播的可靠性-幂等-定序与补偿"},{"level":2,"text":"状态机与时序语义","id":"状态机与时序语义"},{"level":2,"text":"通知、证据与审计随处置一同传播","id":"通知-证据与审计随处置一同传播"},{"level":2,"text":"恢复路径必须与处置路径对称","id":"恢复路径必须与处置路径对称"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"违规分类法与政策规则引擎建模","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/violation-takedown-monitoring/violation-taxonomy-policy-engine"},"next":{"title":"下架前预警信号与异常检测：从指标越线到行为突变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/marketplace-seller-account-health-performance-appeal/violation-takedown-monitoring/warning-signal-anomaly-detection"}}